\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Lord, the gospel is my food,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Sweeter far than milk or honey,
\par And its value is so great
\par None can count its worth in money;
\par For this true and living word
\par Tells how much you love me, Lord.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Jesus, I won't hesitate
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 To accept your invitation,
\par For your gospel's living power
\par Brings about my soul's salvation:
\par You call every needy soul,
\par Offering to make us whole.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. In the Bible I can read
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 How at first you faced temptation,
\par How you did your mighty works,
\par Giving health and liberation,
\par How you died my soul to save,
\par Rose victorious from the grave.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Reading what you said and did
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Helps me trust in you more fully,
\par Treading where your footsteps lead,
\par Following your example truly.
\par May my life from hour to hour
\par \pard        Demonstrate the gospel's power.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

